                                                "sense_id": "5a7eec0b-42fa-371a-af28-1da5add72c25",
                                                "text": "He runs a small trading post in the vicinity of New Hampshire."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "088d893f-2e62-435f-ac00-37de25491942",
                                                "sense_id": "5a7eec0b-42fa-371a-af28-1da5add72c25",
                                                "text": "Further questions elicited from him that Mr Kurtz was at present in charge of a trading post, a very important one, in the true ivory-country, at ‘the very bottom of there. Sends in as much ivory as all the others put together. . .’"
